'''Accuracy and Crits Aura''' is a [[monster aura]]. It is granted by a monster modifier [[Modifier:MonsterModAccuracyAndCritAura|{{c|mod|of Precision}}]] (known as "{{c|normal|Precision Aura}}" under the monster nameplate).

Unique monster's mod may also grant the monster with this aura.

The aura has mostly the same function as {{il|Precision}} aura used by the player, but the monster version was introduced to the game much earlier than the gem variant. Also note that the gem version grants flat Accuracy Rating, while the monster aura grants increased Accuracy Rating. Since Precision and Accuracy and Crits Aura have different names, they can stack on each other.

The mod [[Modifier:MonsterModAccuracyAndCritAura|{{c|normal|Precision Aura}}]] can be stolen by {{il|Headhunter}}, or {{il|Inspired Learning}} to grant the player the aura as well as player's allies. Use of {{il|Conversion Trap}} on non-uniques enemies with the aura produces similar results.

Not to be confused with {{stl|Speed Aura}}, which has a similar-looking visual effect.
